# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.blackflash).
# The black window seen when an application is opened again while it runs: Sileo opened, left to
# draw, opened again by the same URL (the 16:52 run's black at 360 s came 8 s after exactly
# this), then Settings over it. Screenshots every few seconds are the runner's
# (devices/thyme/blackflash.sh), which also drops touch_lat so the run fits the log ring.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 60
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen prefs:
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40 button home wait 10
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
